<span class="badge badge-error">SLA Warning</span>
<h1>SLA Policy Breached or Imminent Warning</h1>
<p>Hello {{recipientName}},</p>
<p>The following support ticket has exceeded or is nearing its SLA policy warning threshold limit. Immediate review is required to prevent a service delivery commitment breach.</p>

<div class="meta-box">
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">Ticket ID:</td>
      <td class="meta-value"><strong>{{ticketNumber}}</strong></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">Subject:</td>
      <td class="meta-value">{{title}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">SLA Limit:</td>
      <td class="meta-value" style="color: #b91c1c;"><strong>{{slaLimitHours}} hours</strong></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">Time Remaining:</td>
      <td class="meta-value">{{timeRemaining}}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<p>You can view the ticket details and record escalation logs by clicking the button below:</p>

{{button "Access Escalated Ticket" actionUrl}}

<p style="margin-top: 24px;">Regards,<br/>CampusCare Service Policy Engine</p>
